        {
          "text": "Yohana Omubatisii",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho mumuyika kwekhumi nakharaano okwomuburuchi bwaKaisari Tiberio, Pondio Pilato nali Kafuna weBuyahudi, naye Herode nali omuruchi weGalilaya, Filipo omusiani wabwe nali omuruchi womumbali tsieIturea nende Turakoniti, khandi Lisania nali omuruchi weAbilene, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mundaalo tsiobukuhani-obukhulundu bwaAnasi nende Kayafa, likhuwa liaNyasaye lia mwitsila Yohana waZakaria nali mushitsiimi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye niyoola mumbali tsiosi etsirondokhana nende Yorodani, niyeelwatsanga akobubatisibwi bwokhwikalukhasia khulwa obuleshelwi bwebionoono; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shinga olwa kahandiikwa mushitabu shiamaKhuwa kaIsaya omunabii, mbu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho yasunjila abemikanda abarulanga nibatsia okhubatisibwa ninaye, ari Inywe olwibulo Iwetsinzokha, niwina owamuchesiyia okhwilukha oburima obuli okhwitsa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho yame ebiamo ebiwinjana nende obwikalukhasii; nimurachaaka okhusunga mumioyo chieenywe muri Khuli nende kuuka weefwe, Aburahamu, tawe; shichila emusunjila mbu mumachina kano Nyasaye anyala okhubuusiliamwo Aburahamu abaana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kata bulaano ihaywa yimalile okhureebwa khubisina biemisaala; kho buli musaala okuraamanga ebiamo ebilayi ta kuremwa, nikusukunwa mumulilo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abemikanda bali nibamureebanga bari Kho khukhole shiina? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakalusia nabasunjila ari Ouli nende tsingubo etsiomukari tsibili, akabane nende oubula ninayo; noyo ouli nebiokhulia, yesi akhole ario. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi abasololi bobushuru nibeetsa okhubatisibwa, nibamureeba bari Omwechesia, khukhole shiina? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabasunjila ari Murasololanga okhushilaasia ebia mwalakwa ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abasikari nabo nibamureeba, bari Nineefwe, khukhole shiina? Nabasunjila ari Muramukholela omundu yesi akamahababa, kata okhubeenjilila itookho khwikhuwa liobubatsa ta; ne murabuutsuluulila omushaara kweenywe tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa abandu bali nibalindiililanga akeetsa okhwikhola, bosi nibakanakania mumioyo chiabwe khuYohana, naba niyakhaba ye Kristo watsana, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yohana yakalusia, nababoolela bosi ari Isie toto emubatisinjia nende amatsi; ne oushila isie amaani yeetsanga; shingwanile okhuboholola olukhoba Iwebilaarobie ta; omwenoyo alamubatisia nende Roho Omutakatifu nende omulilo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ali nolutelu mumukhono, okhulabilia elala olwanyilwe, nokhukhung'aasia ingano mushiachishienebutswa omukhuutsi alakusamba mumulilo okuranyala okhusimibwa ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho mana yabeelwatsila abandu Amakhuwa Amalayi nende obuchesiyi bundi obunji; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne Herode omuruchi, olwa yali nahalabiilwe ninaye khulwa Herodia, omukhasi womusiani wabwe, khandi khulwa amabii ako kosi aka Herode yali nakholile, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yatasakhwo lino elishila akandi kosi, mbu yamwikalila Yohana mumbohe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okhubatisibwa khwaYesu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
